    "searchText": "hauling ask. cargo retrieval hh_olp_atob_wtp_medicalsupplies headhunters careercontract hauling cargo pickup: stanton need someone to snag some cargo for us. we were using an old hathor paf for dead drops, but a local gang has dug in and we can’t get our shit.\n\nif you feel like kicking some ass, grab the cargo from the freight elevator at [location] and deliver it to the freight elevator at [destination]. \n\nfrom what i’ve heard this place is full of all sorts. won’t be easy getting out stuff back, but that’s what we’re paying you for.\n\njust make sure you got a ship that can handle a [missionmaxscusize] load, and try not to get shot in the process. a handheld tractor beam would also be smart to bring along. \n\nstows out. getting our goods back stock taking f56b2ee1-1729-4374-a2d5-f6a5607f3a5d 38437a9a-f57f-4771-8f4f-d5b6612b5cb5 857464b8-d35f-46ef-9c25-409395dfaf28 89aee723-a004-48cc-8cc6-bc3224ff5f5f bd3158f8-4654-43bb-a736-7a1225fd0796 f47a2d1f-8f4f-49c7-9a7c-3e8e9a040495 9bb5529b-54ed-4f46-a37d-634836687ac6 hauling +1,000 credits formula unresolved hauling +200 completion tag"
